PROVENANCE, STATED IN THE BASELINE ITSELF. This digest was measured on 2026-08-02, AFTER the
publish flip. The rest of baseline.regression was captured pre-cutover, when production held
5,510 sections against today's 72,863. The floor file says so and G10's pass line now prints
the capture date, so nobody reads a post-flip digest as an E0 reading.

STILL OPEN: the G10 FORK DISCHARGE. Running the gate end-to-end wants a Neon fork, and branch
creation is forbidden by the standing rails (an owner call). ADR-043 wanted the fork BEFORE
the flip; that departure is now a fact. What A5 discharges is the instrument and the ratchet.
